cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or reference this baseline, please cite it as below, including the version."
title: "Enterprise Agent Identity and Authorization Security Baseline"
abstract: >-
  An open security baseline and self-assessment tool developed by Max Luo during
  Teloa development and security design, initiated and maintained by Teloa AI Security,
  an AI security research and open-source initiative rooted in Teloa development.
  It defines verifiable enterprise agent identity and authorization goals;
  product compliance requires evidence for a specific version and deployment.
  Self-assessment is not independent certification.
version: "1.0"
date-released: 2026-10-07
type: dataset
